  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let $f(k)$ be the minimal $N$ such that if $\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}$ is $k$-coloured then there is a monochromatic solution to $a+b=c$. Estimate $f(k)$. In particular, is it true that $f(k) < c^k$ for some constant $c>0$?",
